## What This Skill Provides

- Test planning templates
- Unit testing patterns (Jest, Vitest, pytest)
- **MSW (Mock Service Worker)** - Network-level API mocking (NOT jest.mock)
- **VCR.py** - HTTP recording for Python tests
- Integration testing patterns
- E2E testing with Playwright
- Coverage targets (≥80% backend, ≥85% frontend)
- Performance testing strategies

## When to Use

- Planning test strategy for new features
- Writing unit tests
- Mocking APIs in frontend tests (use MSW, NOT jest.mock)
- Recording HTTP responses for Python tests (VCR.py)
- Setting up E2E tests
- Improving test coverage

## Critical 2025 Patterns

- **MSW for API mocking** - Use Mock Service Worker, NOT `jest.spyOn(global, 'fetch')`
- **VCR.py for Python** - Record HTTP interactions for deterministic tests
- **Coverage targets** - Backend ≥80%, Frontend ≥85%

